WEBVTT

00:00:12.040 --> 00:00:14.250
"This is a work of fiction. The characters,
organizations, and names herein are fictitious,
and bear no relation to existing entities."

00:00:14.250 --> 00:00:16.200
"This is a work of fiction. The characters,
organizations, and names herein are fictitious,
and bear no relation to existing entities."

00:00:14.250 --> 00:00:16.200
Ikebukuro is the greatest.

00:00:19.040 --> 00:00:22.370
It's a big town in the northwest
part of downtown Tokyo.

00:00:22.370 --> 00:00:24.910
At the foot of the huge office buildings
and department stores,

00:00:24.910 --> 00:00:28.910
throngs of people live peacefully here today.

00:01:01.450 --> 00:01:02.830
Right on schedule!

00:01:02.830 --> 00:01:04.500
We're just reaching the overpass!

00:01:04.500 --> 00:01:07.660
"Ikebukuro West Gate"

00:01:32.160 --> 00:01:35.200
That damn junkie!

00:01:35.200 --> 00:01:36.330
--Everyone's polite and follows the rules.
--Move it!

00:01:36.330 --> 00:01:37.790
--Everyone's polite and follows the rules.
--I'll kill you!

00:01:37.790 --> 00:01:41.160
--Everyone on the street wears a happy smile.
--C'mon, move!

00:01:47.540 --> 00:01:49.410
--There he is!
--We found him!

00:02:16.410 --> 00:02:17.660
G...

00:02:19.410 --> 00:02:21.330
G-Boys!

00:02:34.660 --> 00:02:37.160
King!

00:02:37.160 --> 00:02:39.000
He's here!

00:02:48.410 --> 00:02:52.410
Die!

00:03:09.500 --> 00:03:11.040
That's our King!

00:03:11.040 --> 00:03:12.660
Kick-ass!

00:03:17.120 --> 00:03:20.950
Good job, Makoto.

00:03:20.950 --> 00:03:24.330
You always steal the best part.

00:03:24.330 --> 00:03:25.700
Takashi.

00:03:28.370 --> 00:03:30.790
A town that's nice to everyone.

00:03:30.790 --> 00:03:33.540
Ikebukuro is all about love and peace.

00:03:33.540 --> 00:03:36.870
That's right, Ikebukuro is the greatest!

00:03:48.870 --> 00:03:51.200
"Ikebukuro West Gate Park"

00:05:22.620 --> 00:05:26.160
"Majima Produce"

00:06:02.000 --> 00:06:05.000
Is there some trouble again, Takashi?

00:06:12.290 --> 00:06:16.160
You know that junkie we
chased down the other day?

00:06:16.160 --> 00:06:17.870
It's related to that.

00:06:19.540 --> 00:06:23.370
Is that a new fashion trend?

00:06:23.370 --> 00:06:25.620
Hi there, Takashi-kun.

00:06:25.620 --> 00:06:29.330
Greetings, Ritsuko-san.

00:06:29.330 --> 00:06:31.750
Oh, no.

00:06:31.750 --> 00:06:35.660
You're a girl, so you've got
to keep that face of yours clean.

00:06:35.660 --> 00:06:36.700
A girl?

00:06:36.700 --> 00:06:39.000
Does she look like anything else?

00:06:39.000 --> 00:06:43.250
There we go, all clean.

00:06:43.250 --> 00:06:47.540
Makoto. Don't you have something
important to discuss with Takashi-kun?

00:06:47.540 --> 00:06:51.410
I'll mind the shop,
so you go look after this girl.

00:06:51.410 --> 00:06:54.620
Don't call the shots, Mom.

00:06:54.620 --> 00:06:56.790
What's your name?

00:06:56.790 --> 00:06:58.410
Mion Kurashina.

00:06:58.410 --> 00:06:59.500
How old are you?

00:06:59.500 --> 00:07:03.200
Twelve. What're you going to do with me?

00:07:04.410 --> 00:07:06.040
"Nao Ramen"

00:07:09.620 --> 00:07:11.830
Thanks for your patience!

00:07:11.830 --> 00:07:14.120
An order of miso ramen!

00:07:14.120 --> 00:07:16.500
For Makoto-san, the usual.

00:07:16.500 --> 00:07:18.750
A deluxe fruit ramen!

00:07:18.750 --> 00:07:20.870
That's what I'm talkin' about!

00:07:24.830 --> 00:07:28.870
Only Makoto would be happy
to order such a thing.

00:07:28.870 --> 00:07:32.250
King, thanks for your patience.

00:07:32.250 --> 00:07:35.370
A Rossini, of beef filet and foie gras.

00:07:37.160 --> 00:07:38.830
<i>This </i>is a ramen place?

00:07:38.830 --> 00:07:40.080
Huh?

00:07:40.080 --> 00:07:42.870
Yeah, some former G-Boys run it.

00:07:42.870 --> 00:07:44.910
What are the G-Boys?!

00:07:44.910 --> 00:07:47.580
For that matter, what's the deal with you guys?!

00:07:47.580 --> 00:07:49.580
Explain it to me, already!

00:07:49.580 --> 00:07:54.500
You don't know the G-Boys?
You're not an Ikebukuro kid.

00:07:54.500 --> 00:07:59.040
The G-Boys are a group of bad kids
who all hang out in Ikebukuro.

00:07:59.040 --> 00:08:02.620
Takashi Andou here is known
as "King," and he runs them.

00:08:02.620 --> 00:08:04.750
You could say he's the head hooligan.

00:08:04.750 --> 00:08:08.120
And that guy over there is Hiroto, his #2.

00:08:08.120 --> 00:08:11.450
You said your name's Mion? What happened?

00:08:12.910 --> 00:08:17.830
We're not your enemies or anything.
What would you like me to do?

00:08:26.250 --> 00:08:28.160
Mom is...

00:08:28.160 --> 00:08:30.580
My mom is...!

00:08:32.700 --> 00:08:39.620
The G-Boys discovered Mion trying
to set fire to North Gate Smoke Tower.

00:08:39.620 --> 00:08:42.410
As you know, what's commonly
referred to as Smoke Tower

00:08:42.410 --> 00:08:45.750
is a tall, slender building
right next to Ikebukuro Station.

00:08:45.750 --> 00:08:49.250
Inside are shops that deal in drugs.

00:08:49.250 --> 00:08:54.620
Lately, people who've bought said drugs
have been causing trouble here and there.

00:08:54.620 --> 00:08:59.500
The one who went berserk in front of the
station was on something he bought there.

00:08:59.500 --> 00:09:05.950
Mion says her mother was hospitalized
after getting hit by some junkie's car.

00:09:05.950 --> 00:09:08.450
The perp is on probation.

00:09:08.450 --> 00:09:12.160
He's broke, so there isn't much
chance of collecting compensation.

00:09:12.160 --> 00:09:15.410
Buildings like that should
be burned to the ground!

00:09:15.410 --> 00:09:19.580
Even if you guys try to stop me,
I'm gonna go light it on fire again!

00:09:19.580 --> 00:09:22.200
Hey, where's your father?

00:09:22.200 --> 00:09:25.750
I don't have one. It's just me and Mom.

00:09:25.750 --> 00:09:30.620
She works late into the night
every day to raise me...

00:09:30.620 --> 00:09:34.750
Even on Sundays and holidays...

00:09:34.750 --> 00:09:37.200
But despite that...

00:09:39.950 --> 00:09:42.660
You, too, live alone with your mother.

00:09:42.660 --> 00:09:45.950
You know how she feels, don't you?

00:09:45.950 --> 00:09:47.580
Makoto.

00:09:47.580 --> 00:09:50.750
This is an official request from me.

00:09:50.750 --> 00:09:54.580
Drive North Gate Smoke Tower out of this town.

00:09:54.580 --> 00:09:58.080
It doesn't matter if it's legal or not.

00:09:58.080 --> 00:10:01.580
Drugs are the enemy of the G-Boys.

00:10:01.580 --> 00:10:05.200
You never can say no to a kid's tears.

00:10:05.200 --> 00:10:07.080
More often than you can.

00:10:11.500 --> 00:10:14.790
So, what to do next?

00:10:14.790 --> 00:10:16.790
Are you with the G-Boys, too?

00:10:16.790 --> 00:10:19.040
I'm just a fruit vendor.

00:10:19.040 --> 00:10:21.870
And I'm just Takashi's pal, from way back.

00:10:23.000 --> 00:10:25.580
For an issue like this...

00:10:25.580 --> 00:10:29.160
Yeah, I'd guess it's best to talk to him.

00:10:29.160 --> 00:10:30.830
Him, who?

00:10:40.910 --> 00:10:43.870
Are you really the Ikebukuro police chief?

00:10:43.870 --> 00:10:48.620
It's true. And I've known Makoto
since he was a child.

00:10:48.620 --> 00:10:53.750
He knows a lot about Ikebukuro,
so I often have him help me with cases.

00:10:56.580 --> 00:11:00.870
Reiichirou Yokoyama. I call him "Big Rei."

00:11:00.870 --> 00:11:05.330
He's a UTokyo grad who knows everything,
so I can rely on him at times like this.

00:11:05.330 --> 00:11:10.040
Mion-chan, was it?
You can order anything you like.

00:11:10.040 --> 00:11:11.950
Th-Thank you.

00:11:11.950 --> 00:11:14.580
Now, down to business.

00:11:14.580 --> 00:11:19.580
After all, we've got to get Mion-chan
home before it gets very late.

00:11:19.580 --> 00:11:25.450
There've been signs lately that another
new type of dangerous drug is trending.

00:11:25.450 --> 00:11:27.000
See this, for instance.

00:11:27.000 --> 00:11:33.160
A narcotic synthesized from about 3g
of a dried plant is sprayed in here,

00:11:33.160 --> 00:11:37.660
but it looks like it's simply
being sold for its pleasant scent.

00:11:37.660 --> 00:11:42.370
Taking it affects the brain,
bringing on a temporary high.

00:11:42.370 --> 00:11:45.200
In some cases, it can cause seizures,
elevated heart rate,

00:11:45.200 --> 00:11:50.040
breathing difficulties, lowered
blood pressure, or brain injury.

00:11:50.040 --> 00:11:53.120
The brain cells just collapse and dissolve.

00:11:53.120 --> 00:11:55.870
Can't you just ban it with a law?

00:11:55.870 --> 00:12:00.790
In order to ban it, we have to
confirm it's an illegal substance.

00:12:00.790 --> 00:12:02.830
Therein lies the difficulty.

00:12:02.830 --> 00:12:06.910
Dealers add large quantities
of masking agents like vitamin E,

00:12:06.910 --> 00:12:10.290
and they mix in other
chemicals before they ship it.

00:12:10.290 --> 00:12:13.910
Analysis alone takes
several months, in some cases.

00:12:13.910 --> 00:12:19.450
Even so, regulations have still come
a long way, and there are less shops.

00:12:19.450 --> 00:12:21.370
But at the same time,

00:12:21.370 --> 00:12:25.830
they keep coming up with new drugs
that exploit legal loopholes,

00:12:25.830 --> 00:12:28.580
and they get cleverer about how they sell.

00:12:28.580 --> 00:12:30.580
It truly is a game of cat and mouse.

00:12:30.580 --> 00:12:33.290
So, even the police can't touch these guys.

00:12:33.290 --> 00:12:35.120
Sounds pretty tough.

00:12:35.120 --> 00:12:38.040
You're not giving up, are you?!

00:12:38.040 --> 00:12:40.080
Well...

00:12:40.080 --> 00:12:43.620
I might as well go have a look at their HQ.

00:12:43.620 --> 00:12:47.160
They brazenly set up shop these days.

00:12:47.160 --> 00:12:50.950
I don't think you'll find any
hard evidence if you just waltz in.

00:12:50.950 --> 00:12:56.000
These guys are pushers. There's got
to be some weak spot we can use.

00:12:56.000 --> 00:13:03.040
Besides, if I don't get revenge for her mom,
there's no telling what she'll do.

00:13:04.500 --> 00:13:06.370
I'll figure something out.

00:13:06.370 --> 00:13:08.370
And I'll do it my way.

00:13:10.370 --> 00:13:14.830
I actually feel sorry for those guys,
now that you're on the job.

00:13:14.830 --> 00:13:16.370
However...

00:13:16.370 --> 00:13:20.500
There are often dangerous
organizations hiding behind drugs.

00:13:20.500 --> 00:13:23.000
Be sure not to do anything risky.

00:13:23.000 --> 00:13:25.580
All right. I'll be careful.

00:13:30.370 --> 00:13:32.120
Okay, listen.

00:13:32.120 --> 00:13:33.750
Go home, already!

00:13:33.750 --> 00:13:36.540
Didn't Big Rei say not to do anything risky?!

00:13:36.540 --> 00:13:40.580
No! I'm gonna get a look at
what kind of guys hurt my mom!

00:13:40.580 --> 00:13:42.910
I'm going, too, no matter what!

00:14:09.620 --> 00:14:11.500
"Aroma candles"

00:14:14.080 --> 00:14:15.700
Is this the new one?

00:14:15.700 --> 00:14:18.000
Yeah, we only just got it.

00:14:18.000 --> 00:14:20.410
It costs 10,000 in other shops.

00:14:20.410 --> 00:14:22.910
They seem kind of ordinary.

00:14:22.910 --> 00:14:28.370
Not knowing how bad drugs are doesn't
automatically make someone a fiend.

00:14:28.370 --> 00:14:30.080
It's not just them here.

00:14:30.080 --> 00:14:33.750
This building has plenty of shops
that have nothing to do with drugs.

00:14:33.750 --> 00:14:38.450
Mion, you tried to burn
all <i>those </i>people to death, too.

00:14:40.080 --> 00:14:43.120
Hi, folks, are you looking for something?

00:14:43.120 --> 00:14:45.910
Hey, children aren't allowed in here!

00:14:52.750 --> 00:14:55.410
Not the high-grade herbs!

00:14:55.410 --> 00:14:56.660
Run for it!

00:14:56.660 --> 00:14:59.410
Catch them! We'll get them to pay for it!

00:14:59.410 --> 00:15:01.450
There was no need to up and throw a bottle!

00:15:01.450 --> 00:15:03.540
But I was startled!

00:15:03.540 --> 00:15:05.000
Stop!

00:15:05.000 --> 00:15:05.950
Don't look back!

00:15:05.950 --> 00:15:06.700
"Emergency Exit"

00:15:05.950 --> 00:15:06.700
Don't look back!

00:15:07.290 --> 00:15:09.160
This way!

00:15:09.160 --> 00:15:10.870
Hey!

00:15:14.700 --> 00:15:16.330
We're jumping! Follow me!

00:15:16.330 --> 00:15:17.410
Huh?!

00:15:21.870 --> 00:15:24.250
Okay, now you!

00:15:24.250 --> 00:15:25.660
They went up!

00:15:37.120 --> 00:15:38.540
Shit!

00:15:42.580 --> 00:15:44.910
Looks like he's not chasing us anymore!

00:15:44.910 --> 00:15:46.410
Don't get careless!

00:15:46.410 --> 00:15:49.330
There's a building up ahead
we can enter from the roof!

00:15:49.330 --> 00:15:52.370
We'll hide in there!

00:15:52.370 --> 00:15:54.750
Weren't we not going to do anything risky?!

00:15:54.750 --> 00:15:57.830
That's why I picked a route
that'd be easy even for you!

00:15:57.830 --> 00:15:59.290
Quit complaining!

00:16:02.450 --> 00:16:04.620
That was a close call...

00:16:04.620 --> 00:16:06.200
It was bad news, huh?

00:16:06.200 --> 00:16:11.620
Yeah. But they didn't find out who we are
or what we were doing, so we're okay.

00:16:11.620 --> 00:16:14.620
They probably think we're just nutty customers.

00:16:14.620 --> 00:16:17.580
It's been a while, Makoto.

00:16:21.580 --> 00:16:23.330
Yoshioka...

00:16:23.330 --> 00:16:25.450
Someone else you know?

00:16:30.000 --> 00:16:33.040
"Episode 1"

00:16:34.660 --> 00:16:37.290
So, you're a policeman, too, Yoshioka-san.

00:16:37.290 --> 00:16:41.950
Yeah, I've known Makoto since he was a kid.

00:16:41.950 --> 00:16:45.250
I know pretty much all the bad stuff he's done.

00:16:45.250 --> 00:16:46.410
Like what?

00:16:46.410 --> 00:16:48.080
Let's see.

00:16:48.080 --> 00:16:52.330
When he was about your age,
and in protective custody at the police station,

00:16:52.330 --> 00:16:54.870
--we caught him and his pals trying to
peep into the ladies' changing room.

00:16:54.870 --> 00:16:57.330
--You don't have to bring that up!
--we caught him and his pals trying to
peep into the ladies' changing room.

00:16:57.330 --> 00:17:00.830
God! This is why I don't wanna see you!

00:17:00.830 --> 00:17:06.580
Anyway, <i>now </i>he's a hardworking young man.

00:17:06.580 --> 00:17:09.620
It's a shame, what happened to your mom.

00:17:09.620 --> 00:17:13.540
I've been wanting to do something
about that shop for a while, too.

00:17:13.540 --> 00:17:17.160
That's why I come check in
like this, once in a while.

00:17:17.160 --> 00:17:22.000
There are things we can do,
even if the police can't touch them.

00:17:22.000 --> 00:17:24.160
If you know anything, could you tell me?

00:17:24.160 --> 00:17:29.200
Don't be dumb. How can a cop
give an outsider investigation info?

00:17:34.950 --> 00:17:37.200
Ohkoshi.

00:17:37.200 --> 00:17:39.870
That's the name of Smoke Tower's owner.

00:17:39.870 --> 00:17:42.250
That's all I can tell you.

00:17:44.540 --> 00:17:47.580
Thank you, Detective!

00:17:47.580 --> 00:17:49.160
Makoto!

00:17:50.870 --> 00:17:53.040
"No smoking"

00:17:56.080 --> 00:17:57.870
I found him.

00:17:57.870 --> 00:18:03.410
He's the most likely hit, from underground
websites and old drug-related news.

00:18:03.410 --> 00:18:04.790
"The owner of Ikebukuro North Gate
Smoke Tower, the herbal world's new..."
That's him!

00:18:04.790 --> 00:18:08.790
"The owner of Ikebukuro North Gate
Smoke Tower, the herbal world's new..."
This is Ohkoshi. Seems he's
famous in the medicinal world.

00:18:08.790 --> 00:18:16.870
Also, I hacked into a Smoke Tower
computer and stole some sales data.

00:18:16.870 --> 00:18:22.660
He's a master hacker,
and he can access just about any info.

00:18:22.660 --> 00:18:25.500
His name's Zero-One. Remember that.

00:18:25.500 --> 00:18:28.870
Sales are down only on Wednesday of each week.

00:18:28.870 --> 00:18:34.580
He might be closing early
to check his merch or hold a meeting.

00:18:34.580 --> 00:18:37.450
In other words, on Wednesdays, Ohkoshi...

00:18:37.450 --> 00:18:41.000
...comes to the shop, probably.

00:18:43.790 --> 00:18:46.700
If he's into meds so much he runs a shop,

00:18:46.700 --> 00:18:50.580
I bet he's personally involved
with illegal drugs, too.

00:18:50.580 --> 00:18:54.370
He must be obtaining them through some channel.

00:18:54.370 --> 00:18:59.330
If we pin down where it happens,
we can tip off the police.

00:19:01.040 --> 00:19:01.290
"Nao"

00:19:01.290 --> 00:19:04.750
"Nao"

00:19:01.290 --> 00:19:04.750
We tailed Ohkoshi for several days.

00:19:04.750 --> 00:19:10.250
He also has other shops, and he goes
around to a different one each day.

00:19:10.250 --> 00:19:14.580
Every other day, he drops by
an old apartment before going home.

00:19:14.580 --> 00:19:17.660
Maybe there's something at that apartment?

00:19:17.660 --> 00:19:19.080
On the days Ohkoshi doesn't go,

00:19:19.080 --> 00:19:23.250
the Smoke Tower clerk
stops by after the shop closes.

00:19:23.250 --> 00:19:26.950
We got the lock code from
some security camera footage.

00:19:34.830 --> 00:19:36.950
From here on, it gets too dangerous.

00:19:36.950 --> 00:19:38.540
You wait here.

00:19:38.540 --> 00:19:40.910
Be careful, Makoto.

00:19:40.910 --> 00:19:42.950
You stay here, too.

00:19:42.950 --> 00:19:45.410
Fewer people will stand out less.

00:20:12.500 --> 00:20:14.160
This is...

00:20:14.160 --> 00:20:18.950
An illegal drug factory, probably. I'd say.

00:20:18.950 --> 00:20:21.660
I hear they call setups like this "homegrown."

00:20:21.660 --> 00:20:24.250
Ohkoshi was personally cultivating and producing

00:20:24.250 --> 00:20:26.580
both natural products and dangerous drugs.

00:20:26.580 --> 00:20:29.370
Illegally, of course.

00:20:29.370 --> 00:20:30.910
Yeah.

00:20:30.910 --> 00:20:32.950
We've got him now.

00:20:34.870 --> 00:20:37.660
You're in the G-Boys, too, right?

00:20:37.660 --> 00:20:38.790
Yeah.

00:20:38.790 --> 00:20:40.700
Are you close with Makoto?

00:20:40.700 --> 00:20:47.000
Not really. He's just somebody
King knows. He's not one of us.

00:20:47.000 --> 00:20:48.870
Oh, okay.

00:20:51.540 --> 00:20:53.000
What's wrong?

00:20:53.000 --> 00:20:55.080
That's the guy from Smoke Tower!

00:20:55.080 --> 00:20:57.700
What?! He's here early!

00:21:03.290 --> 00:21:05.330
Hey! What're you gonna do?!

00:21:06.370 --> 00:21:07.580
Ow!

00:21:10.250 --> 00:21:12.660
What's the big idea?!

00:21:14.160 --> 00:21:16.080
Ya little shit!

00:21:20.580 --> 00:21:22.540
--There! Gotcha!
--Ow!

00:21:23.660 --> 00:21:25.370
Makoto!

00:21:30.580 --> 00:21:32.540
You okay, Mion?!

00:21:33.620 --> 00:21:35.120
Makoto!

00:21:36.910 --> 00:21:40.750
Today you stole the best part?

00:21:43.700 --> 00:21:47.000
After that, we moved quickly.

00:21:47.000 --> 00:21:52.660
They knew my face now, so some G-Boys
went to Smoke Tower and posed as customers.

00:21:52.660 --> 00:21:57.370
They hid some drugs we took
from the apartment on a shelf.

00:21:57.370 --> 00:22:02.290
At the same time, Zero-One sent
an anonymous tip email to the police.

00:22:02.290 --> 00:22:06.910
After receiving that, Yoshioka
